sodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"2QMHj84PcBY","position":3,"timestamp":"01:28:49","rawTrack":"Krs - Episode 3","track":{"id":"cNRv8bcGsTw","path":"/artists/krs/tracks/episode-3/","slug":"episode-3","title":"Episode 3","artist":{"slug":"krs","title":"Krs."},"artwork":"images/artists/krs/tracks/episode-3.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nKLM9nMSNZM","slug":"222","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-222/ra.1081593078","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-222-ft-oshi"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #222 ft. Oshi","artwork":"/images/episodes/222.jpg","content":"An interview and guest DJ set from Oshi.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":6904,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-08-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Oshi’s Session","position":1}},{"id":"Ks1lvfFYT-M","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Krs - Bitches n Hoes","track":{"id":"mGJmqRAFWwE","path":"/artists/krs/tracks/bitches-n-hoes/","slug":"bitches-n-hoes","title":"Bitches n Hoes","artist":{"slug":"krs","title":"Krs."},"artwork":"images/artists/krs/tracks/bitches-n-hoes.jpg"},